M10_Stealth_Attack_01/02 bounds. Created() sets loc = 100 and enables
Enemy_Seen; only the first GOTO_LOC timer (1.0 s / 0.25 s later) picks a
valid attack_loc[0..12] index. An Enemy_Seen in that window read
attack_loc[100] past the 13-entry array. Skip Enemy_Seen while loc is out of
range. Behaviour is otherwise unchanged: Modify_Action only applies to
action 10, which exists only after GOTO_LOC has set a valid loc.

